text_en:
The reserve shall be operated by the following methods: <Amended on Mar. 23, 2013; Jul. 26, 2017; Jan. 9, 2024>
Deposits in financial institutions;
Trading and lending of securities under the Financial Investment Services and Capital Markets Act ;
Loans to the State, local governments, and public institutions specified by Decree of the Ministry of Science and ICT;
Loans to insurance policy holders;
Acquisition, disposal, and lease of real estate for business purposes specified by Presidential Decree;
Trading of derivatives under Article 5 of the Financial Investment Services and Capital Markets Act ;
Investment in venture businesses under Article 2 (1) of the Special Act on the Promotion of Venture Businesses;
Deposits in the Treasury Fund;
Loans to financial institutions through fund brokerage companies under Article 355 of the Financial Investment Services and Capital Markets Act ;
Increases of the reserve specified by Presidential Decree.
Where the reserve is operated pursuant to paragraph (1) 2, environmental and social factors, governance, and other factors related to investment targets may be taken into account, so as to boost revenue in a long-term and stable manner. <Added on Aug. 8, 2023>
In order to clarify the performance of the operation of the reserve and the financial status of the reserve, the Minister of Science and ICT shall account for increases, decreases, and changes of assets in accordance with actual occurrences. <Amended on Mar. 23, 2013; Jul. 26, 2017; Aug. 8, 2023>
In order to operate the reserve efficiently, the Minister of Science and ICT may entrust a corporation designated by him or her with all or part of the operation of the business under paragraph (1) 2, 6, 7, and 10 or establish a corporation with the reserve and allow the company to operate the business, as prescribed by Presidential Decree. <Amended on Mar. 23, 2013; Jul. 26, 2017; Aug. 8, 2023>
Matters necessary for the following shall be prescribed by Presidential Decree: <Amended on Aug. 8, 2023>
The ratio of the total acquisition value of securities purchased pursuant to paragraph (1) 2 to the reserve;
The ratio of the total acquisition value of real estate acquired pursuant to paragraph (1) 5 to the reserve;
The ratio of the total acquisition value of derivatives purchased pursuant to paragraph (1) 6 to the reserve;
The limits on investment in venture businesses under paragraph (1) 7;
The limits on loans to financial institutions under paragraph (1) 9.
Matters necessary for the establishment of a plan for the operation of the reserve and the operation of the reserve shall be prescribed by Presidential Decree. <Amended on Aug. 8, 2023>
[This Article Wholly Amended on Jan. 30, 2009]

